        "Try: Help me understand this practice project. First explain; do not install, send, delete, or spend anything. Ask before changes."
      ],
      "proof": "A three-line goal, a clear practice-folder boundary, and one independent check you will perform.",
      "check": {
        "question": "An AI says it installed a tool. What proves it?",
        "choices": [
          "The confidence of its answer",
          "The expected tool/version and a working test on your PC",
          "A generated picture of the app"
        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explanation": "An answer is a claim. Check the actual result where it is supposed to exist."
      },
      "sources": [
        "mdn"
      ],
